{'symbol': 'MSI', 'date': '2021-05-12 05:00:00', 'title': 'IN-CAR VIDEO TECHNOLOGY FROM MOTOROLA SOLUTIONS ASSISTING U.K. POLICE TO “HELP REDUCE ROAD RISK AND INCREASE SAFETY”', 'text': "CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MOTOROLA SOLUTIONS TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE COMPANY HAS SIGNED A FOUR-YEAR SINGLE SUPPLIER FRAMEWORK AGREEMENT WITH BLUELIGHT COMMERCIAL* TO DEPLOY INTEGRATED 4RE IN-CAR VIDEO SOLUTIONS TO ALL EMERGENCY SERVICES IN THE U.K. INCLUDING POLICE, HIGHWAYS AGENCIES, BORDER SECURITY AND THE U.K. HOME OFFICE. THE DEPLOYMENT OF IN-CAR TECHNOLOGY IS PART OF THE NATIONAL POLICE CHIEFS COUNCIL'S ROADS POLICING STRATEGY TO IMPROVE ROAD SAFETY AND SECURITY, AS WELL AS EFFICIENCY. PR"}